Changelog: 20-11-2026 19:26:09

Release 1.5.0.

Changelog: 20-11-2026 18:49:34

Added. The window's new order (owner, 20-11-2026). The header's pills are the shadPS4 version, shadPS4 Install,
shadPS4 Uninstall and Refresh. The row under them is Games Install, Games Uninstall, Available in Steam, shadNet
Account and Play time. Games Uninstall is new: it is what the Remove game… button under the table did, and that
button went. The Your games box went. Under the pills are two columns: the four state lines, each name with a colon
(shadPS4:, Sys modules:, Game folders:, shadNet:), and beside them Installed version:, the shadPS4 version in use.
The tabs are Your games, Start game, Memory cards, Settings, View logs (it was Log) and Clear logs.

Added. A check for a game that is in Steam more than once (owner, 20-11-2026). The app says which games and how
often, the game's In Steam box says it in its tooltip, and Update Steam lights and leaves one shortcut of each, with
the latest play time; its question says how many double shortcuts go.

Fixed. The chosen row of a table is 30 % blue, with the theme's text color: filled with the header's blue, a chosen
first row could hardly be told from the header above it.

Fixed. Start game with Steam closed started Steam and never the game, while the line said "Steam starts". The app
now starts Steam first, waits until it takes commands, then gives it the game's address, again when the game does
not come up (core's play). The line says the game runs only once shadPS4 does, and says when Steam did not start it.
While shadPS4 runs already, Start game starts no second one.

Fixed. A shortcut whose fields Steam wrote in lower case (exe, launchoptions) was not recognized as the app's, so
Update Steam added the game a second time. They are read whatever their case now.

Changelog: 20-11-2026 13:11:18

Release 1.4.0.

Changelog: 20-11-2026 03:39:29

Added. The version manager (owner, 20-11-2026: as shadPS4's own launcher has one; core's builds). The version box in
the header is a pill: its menu lists the shadPS4 builds installed and puts another in use, and Manage versions… opens
the version manager, which downloads the stable releases and the pre-release (a nightly) from GitHub, checked against
the SHA-256 GitHub publishes, adds a custom AppImage, puts a build in use and deletes one. Builds stay side by side:
Install no longer deletes the others, and puts the build this version was tried with back in use, without a download
when it is still there. Uninstall removes every build. A build other than the tested one is said to be not tried on
the board.

Changelog: 19-11-2026 22:33:16

Release 1.3.1.

Changelog: 19-11-2026 22:12:37

Fixed. The message about a newer build says it comes once it has been tried on the board, not the console (owner, 19-11-2026: board everywhere).

Changelog: 18-11-2026 04:15:16

Release 1.3.0.

Changelog: 18-11-2026 02:50:27

Added. The managers' new design, as PPSSPP Manager's, PCSX2 Manager's and RPCS3 Manager's: a Memory cards tab
with the saves shadPS4 keeps, each under its game's title (export to a .zip, import, delete). Clear logs, a tab
beside Log that is a button, empties the app's log file and the Log tab and removes the older log files. Start
game stands beside Your games. The six tabs share the window's whole width and are pills as the ones above them.
Play time moved from the header to the row of action pills. Under the header's pills only the links to shadPS4's
release notes and the wiki are left, in the type of a pill's caption; the introduction went. shadPS4's state is
one line. Under the games an info symbol stands in for the line of text about Steam. The window opens 900 wide
(it was 980), which is its narrowest, and 606 high (it was 800); the Settings tab scrolls when it is higher than
the window.

Changelog: 17-11-2026 14:53:56

Release 1.2.0.

Changelog: 15-11-2026 11:26:39

Release 1.1.0.

Changelog: 15-11-2026 10:16:55

Fixed. Escape and a controller's B are core's exit_keys (the app's own copy is gone): B closes the window only once
the app has had the focus for half a second, so the press that closed another app does not close this one too; a
dialog and a menu keep their own Escape. Start game is core's ActionTab: the arrow keys and Ctrl+Tab pass it by, only a click on it starts the game.

Changelog: 15-11-2026 07:43:15

Release 1.0.2.

Changelog: 15-11-2026 03:22:26

Fixed. The uninstall on a computer where the app is not installed says so ("… is not installed: nothing to remove.")
and stops, without asking for the sudo password; it listed its removal steps for what was never there (owner,
15-11-2026). With anything of the app there, it uninstalls as before.

Changelog: 14-11-2026 13:58:40

Release 1.0.1.

Changelog: 14-11-2026 12:12:03

Fixed. The tooltip and the log line about a newer shadPS4 release say "once it has been tried on the console", not "on
the board". Extract PKG's note under the destination folder no longer points to an Add folder button the app does not
have: for a folder that is not one of shadPS4's game folders it says the game will not show in the list, and names the
folders to extract into. Comments say the console instead of the board.

